__pycache__
/.vscode
/build
/rust/target

# WebUI: dependencies, the generated icon module, and the build output. `build.sh pack`
# runs `npm ci` + the icon generator + vite, so all three are reproducible; what ships
# is what was just built (same rule as the binary).
/webui/node_modules
/webui/icons.js
/magisk/webroot

# Agent scratch/planning state (wayfinder tickets, session notes). Never a deliverable:
# the conclusions belong in docs/, the reasoning in AGENT.md.
/.hermes

# Built module binaries. They are products of `build.sh pack`, identical to the build
# output; tracking them put a 2.1 MB blob and a 300 KB cdylib in the repository on every
# rebuild. Third-party `magisk/bin/busybox/busybox` is NOT here — it cannot be built.
/magisk/bin/uperf
/magisk/bin/libsfanalysis_rs.so
